OL,3,ATrump pledges $5,000 to every American
OL,4,Aif Republicans win November elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says he will
OL,7,Foffer every adult American a $5,000
OL,8,F(#3,700) payout if Republicans win both
OL,9,Fchambers of Congress in November's
OL,10,Fmidterm elections - a plan that would
OL,11,Fcost more than a trillion dollars.
OL,13,FThe controversial offer was made in a
OL,14,Fspeech at the party's first-ever
OL,15,Fconvention in the middle of a US
OL,16,Fpresidential term.
OL,18,FHe gave no details on how the plan
OL,19,Fwould work or where the money would
OL,20,Fcome from - saying only that the money
OL,21,Fwould have to be spent in the US.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
